sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant CRON as GitHub Actions cron
    participant FETCH as scripts/fetch-prices.mjs
    participant SRC as price-sources
    participant SAN as _types.sanitizeRecord
    participant RENDER as lib/price-render.mjs
    participant FS as src/data files
    participant CI as CI Gate
    participant USER as 站点访客

    CRON->>FETCH: node scripts/fetch-prices.mjs
    FETCH->>FS: 读 deviceIds 扫描 phones + tablets + laptops
    FETCH->>FS: 读昨日 PRICES 与 PRICE_SNAPSHOT 作为基线
    loop 按 priority 遍历启用的源
        FETCH->>SRC: fetch deviceIds
        alt 源返回 ok true
            SRC-->>FETCH: records
        else 源失败或未启用
            SRC-->>FETCH: ok false errors
            Note over FETCH: 仅 warning 不中止
        end
    end
    FETCH->>SAN: 逐条 sanitize 价格区间 整数 id 存在 偏离 40 百分比
    SAN-->>FETCH: 有效记录 与 丢弃明细
    FETCH->>FETCH: 闸门2 覆盖率是否低于基线 80 百分比
    alt 覆盖率不足 或 全部源失败
        FETCH-->>CRON: exit 0 不写入 保留昨日价
        Note over FS: prices.ts 原封不动
    else 通过
        FETCH->>RENDER: renderModule records 生成 prices 文本
        FETCH->>RENDER: renderMeta snapshot 生成 priceMeta 文本
        FETCH->>FS: 写 prices.next 校验后 cp prices.prev 再 mv 覆盖 prices
        FETCH-->>CRON: exit 0
    end
    CRON->>CI: npm run typecheck 且 npm test 且 npm run build
    alt 任一失败
        CI-->>CRON: 不提交 仓库保留昨日数据
    else 全绿
        CRON->>CRON: git commit 与 push 触发 deploy.yml
        CRON-->>USER: Pages 更新 展示新价 与 snapshotDate
    end
    USER->>USER: priceFreshness 渲染最后更新日期
